  "decision_conditions": [
    "LIMITED CONSENT PERIOD - TEMPORARY USE: The Sui-Generis (Vehicle Fleet Depot) use of the land hereby approved is granted only for a limited period, being three years from the date of this permission. On or before this date the temporary use shall cease. \r\n\r\nOn the cessation of the temporary use hereby granted the building and land shall revert to the B2 (General Industry) use for which it was previously used prior to the grant of this planning permission.\r\n\r\nREASON:  The temporary use is such that the Local Planning Authority is only prepared to grant permission for a limited period in view of the special circumstances of this case and to protect Site Allocation NH9. The limitation of the consent period ensures compliance with Policies H1, SA1 and SP5 and section 57(2) of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended)."
